      "created_at": "2013-07-08T18:55:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Thanks for the response. I get what you are saying about Tachy having to do at least 1 damage, but don't understand what you mean by \"main villain\".</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For example, last night some friends and I faught against the Matriarch, Spite and Omnitron. Would we have had to kill all three of them in order to win or would killing just one of them have been enough?</p>",
