      "raw": "[quote=\"sol4gratia\"]\n\n last night some friends and I faught against the Matriarch, Spite and Omnitron. Would we have had to kill all three of them in order to win or would killing just one of them have been enough? \n\n[/quote]\n\n At the same time? Trust me, Matriarch is&nbsp;<em>PLENTY</em> hard enough on her own without needing that kind of assistance. Were you playing with like 10 heros or something? \n",
